Route35_Interior1_Text_Fisher::
	.string "BILL’s PC can store up to 30\n"
	.string "POKéMON per BOX.$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_Woman3_1::
	.string "A strange tree is blocking the road.\n"
	.string "It wriggles around if you talk to it.\p"
	.string "I heard it became wild when someone\n"
	.string "watered it with a SQUIRTBOTTLE.$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_Woman3_2::
	.string "I like the POKéMON Lullaby they play\n"
	.string "on the radio.$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_1::
	.string "Excuse me, guy!\n"
	.string "Can you do a guy a favor?\p"
	.string "Can you take this POKéMON with MAIL\n"
	.string "to my friend?\p"
	.string "He’s on ROUTE 31.$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_2::
	.string "Oh... Never mind, then...$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_3::
	.string "My pal was snoozing, right? Heh,\n"
	.string "what’d I say?$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_4::
	.string "Thanks, guy! You made the delivery\n"
	.string "for me!\p"
	.string "Here’s something for your trouble!$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_5::
	.string "You can read it, but don’t lose it!\n"
	.string "ROUTE 31!\p"
	.string "Oh, yeah. There was a weird tree\n"
	.string "blocking the road.\p"
	.string "I wonder if it’s been cleared?$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_6::
	.string "You will? Perfect!\n"
	.string "Thanks, guy!\p"
	.string "My pal’s a chubby guy who snoozes\n"
	.string "all the time.\p"
	.string "You’ll recognize him right away!$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_7::
	.string "You can’t carry another POKéMON...$"

Route35_Interior1_Text_MgDeliveryman_8::
	.string "{PLAYER} received a POKéMON\n"
	.string "with MAIL.$"
